# Only the documentation website is built here. Everything below is either irrelevant to that build
# or must never leave this machine — keep the upload minimal rather than trusting the build to
# ignore it. The website renders docs/** and the repo-root assets/, so those must stay.
#
# Every path is anchored with a leading slash. An unanchored `memory` also matches `docs/memory/`,
# which silently dropped three documentation pages from the build — caught only because
# website/scripts/verify-build.ts asserts every expected route exists.
/.git
/node_modules
/website/node_modules
/website/dist
/vendor
/memory
/.brain
/.claude
/overlay
/tui
/harness
/templates
/scripts/systemd
*.log
